---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Return & Refund Policy | Jaipur Balloon Decoration" description="Understand our return and refund policy for balloon decoration services in Jaipur. Learn about cancellation timelines and refund eligibility.">
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#1f2a44]">Return &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#6b7a99]">Last updated: June 2025</p>

		<div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#4f5e7c]">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">1. Cancellation Window</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">We understand that plans can change. You may cancel your booking within the timeframes below:</p>
				<ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
					<li><strong>More than 48 hours before the event:</strong> Full refund of any advance paid.</li>
					<li><strong>24–48 hours before the event:</strong> 50% refund of any advance paid.</li>
					<li><strong>Less than 24 hours before the event:</strong> No refund applicable.</li>
					<li><strong>Same-day cancellation:</strong> Full booking amount is charged.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">2. How to Request a Cancellation</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">To cancel your booking, contact us via WhatsApp or call at <a href="tel:+918690924378" class="text-[#6b3fe7] underline">+91 86909 24378</a>. Please have your booking reference or confirmation details ready.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">3. Refund Processing</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">Eligible refunds will be processed within 5–7 business days to the original payment method. We do not charge any processing fee for refunds.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">4. Non-Refundable Situations</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">Refunds are not applicable in the following cases:</p>
				<ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
					<li>Cancellation within 24 hours of the scheduled event.</li>
					<li>Work has already commenced at the venue.</li>
					<li>Custom or bespoke items have already been procured.</li>
					<li>Cancellation due to customer failure to provide venue access.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">5. Service Quality Complaints</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">If you are unsatisfied with our service, please reach out to us within 24 hours of event completion. We will review all complaints and work towards a fair resolution, which may include partial refund or a complimentary service.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">6. Contact Us</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">For refund-related queries, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@balloondecorjaipur.com" class="text-[#6b3fe7] underline">info@balloondecorjaipur.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+918690924378" class="text-[#6b3fe7] underline">+91 86909 24378</a>.</p>
			</section>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#6b3fe7] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white">
				← Back to Home
			</a>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

